---
// Why the Hub Exists section — Purpose statement hero preceding Who We Are
---
<!-- =====================================================================
     WHY THE HUB EXISTS
     ===================================================================== -->
<section id="why-hub-exists" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-paper border-t border-hairline scroll-mt-24">
  <!-- Subtle architectural grid pattern from brand guide -->
  <span class="absolute inset-0 pat-grid pat-sweep pointer-events-none" style="--pat:#1D1D1B" aria-hidden="true"></span>

  <div class="shell py-[clamp(56px,7vw,104px)] relative z-10">
    <!-- Kicker: Why the Hub exists -->
    <div class="mb-[clamp(28px,3.5vw,48px)] reveal">
      <p class="kicker">
        01 / WHY THE HUB EXISTS
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.15fr)_minmax(0,0.85fr)] gap-x-[clamp(36px,5.5vw,84px)] gap-y-10 items-start">
      <!-- Left: Heavy Statement Heading (Ink & Teal, -0.055em tracking) -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2 class="font-[800] uppercase text-[clamp(42px,5.8vw,80px)] leading-[0.93] tracking-[-0.055em] m-0 text-balance">
          <span class="block text-ink">THE TALENT</span>
          <span class="block text-ink">IS HERE.</span>
          <span class="block text-teal">THE ROUTE</span>
          <span class="block text-teal">WAS NOT.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Subhead, Paragraph, Action -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-[48ch] lg:pt-1 reveal" style="--d:120ms">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[clamp(20px,2.1vw,27px)] leading-[1.28] tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink text-balance">
          Ghana has strong AI talent, entrepreneurial energy and government backing through the National AI Strategy.
        </h3>

        <p class="text-body text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] leading-[1.7]">
          What has been missing is a structured access point to European markets. The Hub closes that gap: one counterpart European organisations can contract with, and one route Ghanaian professionals and founders can build a career through. All surpluses are reinvested in AI skills, jobs and businesses.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="#why"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-ink hover:text-teal transition-colors pb-1 border-b-[2px] border-ink hover:border-teal group w-fit"
          >
            <span>See how it works</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-y-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <use href="#i-arrow-down" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
